@ref Dieu 127 (src:2734-2743; src:law139-2025-qh15:222-233)
GIVEN e IS A `Two engagements of an individual agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` e MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN `the two principals are of the same kind` (e's `first principal`) (e's `second principal`)
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN     (    `the principal is an insurer or foreign non-life branch` (e's `first principal`)
                     AND `the principal is an insurer or foreign non-life branch` (e's `second principal`)
                     AND `the lists share a type` (e's `types of insurance the first principal carries on`) (e's `types of insurance the second principal carries on`))
                OR (    e's `first principal` EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`
                    AND e's `second principal` EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`)
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

GIVEN k IS A `A kind of insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the principal is an insurer or foreign non-life branch` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a life insurer`                          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a non-life insurer`                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a health insurer`                        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`  THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF `A type of insurance`
      ys IS A LIST OF `A type of insurance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the lists share a type` xs ys MEANS
    any (GIVEN x YIELD elem x ys) xs

GIVEN a IS A `A kind of insurer`
      b IS A `A kind of insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the two principals are of the same kind` a b MEANS
        (a EQUALS `a life insurer` AND b EQUALS `a life insurer`)
    OR  (    (a EQUALS `a non-life insurer` OR a EQUALS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`)
         AND (b EQUALS `a non-life insurer` OR b EQUALS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`))
    OR  (a EQUALS `a health insurer` AND b EQUALS `a health insurer`)
    OR  (a EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation` AND b EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`)

