GIVEN p IS AN `An agent's practice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(3)-(4): the agent practises as the Law requires` p MEANS
    p's `acts only on products the agent was trained on` AND p's `the agent's data is registered and kept current in the insurance database`

GIVEN p IS AN `An agent's practice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(5): the individual must pass the examination for a new certificate before acting` p MEANS
    p's `continuous years without acting as an agent` AT LEAST 3

